   - **Ruled out as consumers needing changes**: WorkflowView.tsx:141 `agent.toolCalls` is a local numeric field (workflow agent summary), not node.toolCalls; workspace-files.ts:110 and cli-import.ts:250 are server-side reading full toolCalls from repo (unaffected); sessionStore streaming path (2867-2933) appends toolCalls via stream events (unaffected).
